{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"939","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. Cutlet"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"4 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Arkady wants to have a dinner. He has just returned from a shop where he has bought a semifinished cutlet. He only needs to fry it. The cutlet should be fried for "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2n"},{"kind":"text","text":" seconds, in particular, it should be fried for "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" seconds on one side and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" seconds on the other side. Arkady has already got a frying pan and turn on fire, but understood that maybe he won't be able to flip the cutlet exactly after "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" seconds after the beginning of cooking."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Arkady is too busy with sorting sticker packs in his favorite messenger and can flip the cutlet only in some periods of time. Namely, there are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" periods of time in which he can do it, the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th of them is an interval of time from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"li"},{"kind":"text","text":" seconds after he starts cooking till "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ri"},{"kind":"text","text":" seconds, inclusive. Arkady decided that it's not required to flip the cutlet exactly in the middle of cooking, instead, he will flip it several times in such a way that the cutlet will be fried exactly "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" seconds on one side and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" seconds on the other side in total."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Help Arkady and find out if it's possible for him to cook the cutlet, if he is able to flip the cutlet only in given periods of time; and if yes, find the minimum number of flips he needs to cook the cutlet."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 100 000"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ k ≤ 100"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of seconds the cutlet should be cooked on each side and number of periods of time in which Arkady can flip it."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contain descriptions of these intervals. Each line contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"li"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ri"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ li ≤ ri ≤ 2·n"},{"kind":"text","text":"), meaning that Arkady can flip the cutlet in any moment starting from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"li"},{"kind":"text","text":" seconds after the beginning of cooking and finishing at "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ri"},{"kind":"text","text":" seconds after beginning of cooking. In particular, if "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"li = ri"},{"kind":"text","text":" then Arkady can flip the cutlet only in the moment "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"li = ri"},{"kind":"text","text":". It's guaranteed that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"li > ri - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" for all "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2 ≤ i ≤ k"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Hungry"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" if Arkady won't be able to fry the cutlet for exactly "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" seconds on one side and exactly "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" seconds on the other side."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Otherwise, output \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Full"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" in the first line, and the minimum number of times he should flip the cutlet in the second line."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"10 2\n3 5\n11 13\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"Full\n2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"10 3\n3 5\n9 10\n11 13\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"Full\n1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"20 1\n3 19\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"Hungry\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example Arkady should flip the cutlet in time moment "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":" seconds after he starts cooking and in time moment "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"13"},{"kind":"text","text":" seconds after he starts cooking."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example, Arkady can flip the cutlet at "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"10"},{"kind":"text","text":" seconds after he starts cooking."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"939F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/939/problem/F"}